<section style="min-height: 180px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: var(--space-lg) 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">

  <!-- Faint wave SVG background -->
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 120" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
       style="position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; opacity: 0.03; pointer-events: none;">
    <path d="M0 60 C360 20, 720 100, 1080 60 S1440 20, 1440 60"
          stroke="white" stroke-width="1" fill="none"/>
    <path d="M0 80 C360 40, 720 120, 1080 80 S1440 40, 1440 80"
          stroke="white" stroke-width="0.5" fill="none"/>
  </svg>

  <!-- Content -->
  <div style="position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; text-align: center;">

    <!-- Small EN label -->
    <p style="font-style: italic; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;">
      "Why Kairos?"
    </p>

    <!-- Main PT quote -->
    <p style="font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.4rem); font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-primary); line-height: 1.65;">
      "Kairos é o momento certo. Não qualquer momento —<br>
      o momento preciso em que agir faz toda a diferença."
    </p>

    <!-- Sub EN text -->
    <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 1rem; line-height: 1.7;">
      In ancient Greek, kairos meant the opportune moment.<br>
      That's what we give your business.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>
